    firstOrderDeformations: firstOrderDeformations, -- use tangent space to
    create first order perturbations and find relations
  * "localHilbertScheme(...,DefParam=>...)" -- see *note localHilbertScheme:
    localHilbertScheme, -- computes a power series representation of the local
    Hilbert scheme

